async function compressCreatorAvatar(file){if(!(file instanceof File)||!file.size)throw new Error('请选择头像图片');if(file.size>12*1024*1024)throw new Error('原图不能超过 12MB');let source=null,width=0,height=0,cleanup=()=>{};if('createImageBitmap'in window){source=await createImageBitmap(file);width=source.width;height=source.height;cleanup=()=>source.close?.()}else{source=new Image();const url=URL.createObjectURL(file);cleanup=()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url);await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{source.onload=resolve;source.onerror=()=>reject(new Error('无法读取头像图片'));source.src=url});width=source.naturalWidth;height=source.naturalHeight}if(!width||!height){cleanup();throw new Error('头像图片尺寸无效')}const canvas=document.createElement('canvas'),size=256,side=Math.min(width,height),sx=(width-side)/2,sy=(height-side)/2;canvas.width=size;canvas.height=size;const context=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:false});context.fillStyle='#fff';context.fillRect(0,0,size,size);context.drawImage(source,sx,sy,side,side,0,0,size,size);cleanup();const blob=await new Promise(resolve=>canvas.toBlob(resolve,'image/webp',.82));if(!blob||blob.size>512*1024)throw new Error('头像压缩失败，请换一张图片');return blob}
function blobDataUrl(blob){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(String(reader.result||''));reader.onerror=()=>reject(new Error('头像转换失败'));reader.readAsDataURL(blob)})}
